cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VPO, please cite the paper below."
title: "VPO: Vector Policy Optimization"
abstract: >-
  A drop-in replacement for the GRPO advantage estimator that keeps the reward a
  vector and trains the policy to emit a set of solutions spread across different
  trade-offs, optimizing over randomly sampled weightings of the objectives.
repository-code: "https://github.com/ryanboldi/vpo"
